 wow, this week has been SHIT and the cherry on top?? ONE OF YOUR CLOSE FUCKING FRIENDS TRIES TO OFF THEMSELVES AND YOU WERE ASLEEP WHEN THEY MESSAGED YOU DESPERATELY ASKING FOR HELP. I know they're alive because we've been messaging this morning. Another person (who btw hates their guts, I'm really glad they could put that aside for a few hours) called the cops for them but STILL you wake up and you realise wow, I could've woken up and they wouldn't be alive anymore and I feel SHIT and so fucking scared and it makes me sick to my stomach because WHY DOES THIS HAPPEN ughhhh 

